@Kodu24.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5134

### Kõik linnaosad
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/districts
Accept: application/json

### Tundmatu tee -> 404 ProblemDetails
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/olematu

### Registreerimine
POST {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "uus.kasutaja@kodu24.ee",
  "password": "Parool123!",
  "fullName": "Kati Karu",
  "phone": "+3725551234",
  "role": "Seeker"
}

### Sisselogimine (testkonto)
# @name login
POST {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "liis@kodu24.ee",
  "password": "Parool123!"
}

### Sisselogitud kasutaja (token eelmisest päringust)
GET {{Kodu24.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

###
